# Claude Ultimate Quota Sentinel (`claude-ultimate-quota-sentinel`)

Claude 3.7 Sonnet and Opus are the world's most capable coding models, but their computational economics demand strict discipline:
- **Output & Thinking Tokens** are the most expensive tier (\$15/M on Sonnet, \$75/M on Opus) and burn rolling 5-hour rate limits rapidly.
- **Uncached Input Tokens** (\$3/M on Sonnet, \$15/M on Opus) multiply with every turn unless anchored by **Prompt Caching** (\$0.30/M on Sonnet — a **90% discount**).
- A broken cache or context runaway can exhaust an entire weekly quota in hours.

This skill is the **unified defense-in-depth quota conservation engine** for Claude Code, integrating 6 autonomous preservation pillars.

---

